WEBVTT

00:04:57.499 --> 00:05:00.735
(Laughter)

00:05:00.759 --> 00:05:05.471
Initially, yeah, that was a little much,

00:05:05.495 --> 00:05:07.973
but eventually, I overcame my hesitancy.

00:05:08.803 --> 00:05:14.510
As it turned out, the circle was
the vision of a man named Patrick Nolan,

00:05:14.534 --> 00:05:16.468
who was also serving life

00:05:16.492 --> 00:05:20.838
and who had grown sick and tired
of being sick and tired

00:05:20.862 --> 00:05:22.638
of watching us kill one another

00:05:23.598 --> 00:05:24.891
over skin color,

00:05:25.931 --> 00:05:27.090
rag color,

00:05:28.870 --> 00:05:31.688
being from Northern
or Southern California,